**Project Overview**
This project focuses on analyzing e-commerce sales data using Microsoft Excel. The objective is to transform raw sales data into meaningful business insights and understand sales performance, customer behavior, product performance, and delivery efficiency.

**Dataset Description**
**The dataset contains the following columns:**
Order_ID,
Customer_ID,
Product_ID,
Order_Date,
Order_Time,
Delivery_Date,
Quantity,
Unit_Price,
Order_Value,
Shipping_Cost,
Coupon_Code,
Coupon_Discount,
Total_Amount,
Payment_Mode,
Order_Status,
Rating,
Review_Text,
City,
State,
Customer_Age,
Customer_Age_Group,
ORDER_MONTH,
DELIVERY_TIME,
DELIVERY_DELAYED

**Tools & Technologies**
Microsoft Excel,
PivotTables,
PivotCharts,
Excel Formulas,
Slicers,
Conditional Formatting,
Data Cleaning,
